{"7":["              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">We keep personal information only for as long as it is reasonably needed.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">The period depends on things such as:</p>","              <ul style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 22px;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">why we collected it;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">tax and accounting requirements;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">food-safety and traceability obligations;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">complaint or insurance requirements;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">fraud prevention;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">legal claims; and</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">whether you still have an active relationship with Abby&#8217;s Table.</li>\n              </ul>","              <!-- PLACEHOLDER retention periods: none supplied. Every row is marked rather than\n                   carrying an invented figure — a wrong retention period in a published policy is a\n                   compliance statement, not a copy detail. -->\n              <dl class=\"at-p-pairs\" style=\"margin: 16px 0 0;\">\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Orders and accounting records</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Customer account information</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Customer enquiries</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Complaint records</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Complaint images</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Food-safety and recall records</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Refund records</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Private Table waitlist</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Marketing preferences</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Security logs</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"at-p-pair\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--green-forest);\">Cookie and analytics information</dt>\n                  <dd class=\"at-p-pair-v\" style=\"margin: 2px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--taupe);\"><span class=\"at-p-pair-k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Retention: </span>To be confirmed</dd>\n                </div>\n              </dl>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">We may keep particular information for longer where this is necessary to comply with the law, manage a food-safety matter, prevent fraud or establish or defend a legal claim.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">When information is no longer needed, we delete, anonymise or otherwise dispose of it appropriately.</p>"],"8":["              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Depending on the circumstances, you may have the right to:</p>","              <dl style=\"margin: 16px 0 0;\">\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Access</dt>\n                  <dd style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Ask for a copy of personal information we hold about you.</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Correct</dt>\n                  <dd style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Ask us to correct inaccurate or incomplete information.</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Delete</dt>\n                  <dd style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Ask us to delete information where the law gives you that right.</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Restrict</dt>\n                  <dd style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Ask us to limit how we use certain information.</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Data portability</dt>\n                  <dd style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Ask to receive certain information in a reusable electronic format.</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Object</dt>\n                  <dd style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Object to certain uses of your information.</dd>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n                  <dt style=\"font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Withdraw consent</dt>\n                  <dd style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Withdraw consent where we rely on consent.</dd>\n                </div>\n              </dl>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Withdrawing consent does not make earlier lawful use of your information unlawful.</p>","              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Your right to object to marketing</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600; color: var(--green-forest);\">You can object to the use of your personal information for direct marketing at any time.</strong></p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">If you do, we will stop using your information for that purpose.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">You may also have a right to object where we rely on legitimate interests.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">To exercise any of your privacy rights, email <a class=\"at-tlink\" href=\"mailto:hello@FromAbbysTable.co.uk\" style=\"color: var(--green-forest); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;\">hello@FromAbbysTable.co.uk</a> or use our <a class=\"at-tlink\" href=\"Abby's Table - Contact Us.dc.html\" style=\"color: var(--green-forest); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;\">contact form</a>.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">We may ask for reasonable information to confirm your identity.</p>","              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Closing your account</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">You can ask us to close your Abby&#8217;s Table account.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Closing your account does not always mean that every record can immediately be deleted.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">For example, we may need to keep records relating to:</p>","              <ul style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 22px;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">previous orders;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">tax and accounting;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">refunds;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">food safety;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">product recalls;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">fraud prevention;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">complaints; or</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">legal claims.</li>\n              </ul>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Any information we retain will continue to be handled in accordance with this policy.</p>"],"9":["              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">Keeping your information secure</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">We use appropriate technical and organisational measures designed to protect personal information from:</p>","              <ul style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 22px;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">loss;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">misuse;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">unauthorised access;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">alteration; and</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">unlawful disclosure.</li>\n              </ul>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">These measures may include appropriate access controls, secure service providers, authentication, encryption, monitoring and staff procedures.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">No online system can be guaranteed to be completely secure, but we regularly review the safeguards appropriate to the information we hold.</p>","              <h4 style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--green-forest);\">International transfers</h4>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Some of the organisations that provide services to Abby&#8217;s Table may process information outside the United Kingdom.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Where UK data-protection law requires safeguards for an international transfer, we use an appropriate legal mechanism.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">This may include:</p>","              <ul style=\"margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 22px;\">\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">a UK adequacy arrangement;</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">approved contractual safeguards; or</li>\n                <li style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">another legally permitted mechanism.</li>\n              </ul>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">You can contact us if you would like more information about the safeguards relating to a particular transfer.</p>"],"10":["              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">If you have a question, concern or complaint about how Abby&#8217;s Table uses your personal information, please contact us.</p>","              <div class=\"at-t-info\" style=\"margin-top: 18px; background: var(--cream-2); border: 1px solid var(--sand); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px 22px;\">\n                <div>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--brown);\">Email</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--green-forest);\"><a class=\"at-tlink\" href=\"mailto:hello@FromAbbysTable.co.uk\" style=\"color: var(--green-forest); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;\">hello@FromAbbysTable.co.uk</a></p>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--brown);\">Telephone</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--green-forest);\"><a class=\"at-tlink\" href=\"tel:+442038751234\" style=\"color: var(--green-forest); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;\">020 3875 1234</a></p>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--brown);\">Online</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 3px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--weight-medium); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--green-forest);\"><a class=\"at-tlink\" href=\"Abby's Table - Contact Us.dc.html\" style=\"color: var(--green-forest); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;\">Contact form</a></p>\n                </div>\n              </div>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">We will take appropriate steps to investigate privacy complaints and respond within the timescales required by law.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">You also have the right to complain to the <strong style=\"font-weight: 600; color: var(--green-forest);\">Information Commissioner&#8217;s Office (ICO)</strong>, the UK&#8217;s independent data-protection regulator.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 14px 0 0; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--brown); text-wrap: pretty;\">Contacting Abby&#8217;s Table first does not affect your right to contact the ICO.</p>","              <p style=\"margin: 18px 0 0;\"><a class=\"at-tlink\" href=\"https://ico.org.uk\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brass-ink); text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brass); padding-bottom: 1px;\">Contact the ICO</span><span class=\"at-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&#8594;</span></a></p>"]}